OL,3,GNEWSAManx language festival returns to
OL,4,Athe island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manx language festival, Cooish
OL,7,FVooar, has returned to the island, with
OL,8,Fmore than 32 events taking place across
OL,9,Ffive days.
OL,11,FOrganised by Culture Vannin in
OL,12,Fpartnership with Jeebin, the Manx
OL,13,FLanguage Network, the event started on
OL,14,FFriday and will end on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe festival opened with the premiere
OL,17,Fof the world's first Manx-language
OL,18,Fopera, Caillagh, composed by Matthew
OL,19,FWarren and written by Bob Carswell, and
OL,20,Fthis year's event coincides with Blein
OL,21,Fny Gaelgey, the Year of the Manx
OL,22,FLanguage.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
